y the total illnesses\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"averted outcomes attributable to vaccination were estimated as the difference between outcomes in the hypothetical unvaccinated population\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Hospitalization rates were adjusted for underreporting based on surveys conducted during the 2009 influenza pandemic\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Estimates of the cumulative monthly proportion vaccinated through end of April of each season were developed using the Kaplan-Meier product limit method\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Negative lower 95% confidence intervals (CI) were revised to 0.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}